DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9328::$$$message_0070_0000_0000$$$::I spend time absentmindedly in the student council room.::
9329::$$$message_0070_0001_0000$$$::"...Hm. Gold moves to 82 and captures the bishop.[lr]::
9330::$$$message_0070_0001_0001$$$::Wait, would this be two extra moves...?"[lr]::
9331::$$$message_0070_0001_0002$$$::Issei must not have any work either, as he's enjoying an old magazine of shogi puzzles.::
9332::$$$message_0070_0002_0000$$$::It would be good if there was a shogi board and pieces, but there's no such equipment in the student council room. It's Issei's policy to try not to bring in recreational goods at all because it would set a bad example. [lr]::
9333::$$$message_0070_0002_0001$$$::I've also been enjoying the crossword puzzle published by the newspaper club, "A Hundred Battles from Taiga Fujimura's Past," but it's more bleak than fun because of its genre.::
9334::$$$message_0070_0003_0000$$$::"Mrgh, can't this knight get out of the way? It's an eyesore... [cacheimage storage=一成02a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=一成02a(中)]Ugh, give me some tea, Emiya! Make it hot enough to make my brain tingle, will you?"[lr]::
9335::$$$message_0070_0003_0001$$$::"All right. Oh, there's some red bean jelly left, do you want some?"[lr]::
9336::$$$message_0070_0003_0002$$$::"Hm. That's a tempting suggestion, but I shall wait till my break at three. I must maintain a regular routine with snacks."::
9337::$$$message_0070_0004_0000$$$::Apparently right now isn't his break time.[lr]::
9338::$$$message_0070_0004_0001$$$::Thirty more minutes until three.[lr]::
9339::$$$message_0070_0004_0002$$$::It must be the quota that he has imposed on himself, as he seems to have the intention to solve the third question of the advanced shogi puzzles.::
9340::$$$message_0070_0005_0000$$$::I get up from my seat to brew some tea.[lr]::
9341::$$$message_0070_0005_0001$$$::"Oh? Issei, someone's here."::
9342::$$$message_0070_0006_0000$$$::Issei hides the old magazine swiftly under his desk.[lr]::
9343::$$$message_0070_0006_0001$$$::"Excuse us. This is Sakura Matou from class 2-B[line len=3][cacheimage storage=桜制服10b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜制服10b(中)]oh, it's Senpai."::
9344::$$$message_0070_0007_0000$$$::"Hey, excuse us, Student Council President[wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=美綴02a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=美綴02a(中)]...wait, why are you here, Emiya?"[lr]::
9345::$$$message_0070_0007_0001$$$::The visitors are a familiar duo.[lr]::
9346::$$$message_0070_0007_0002$$$::It must be related to the kyudo club if they're together at school.::
9347::$$$message_0070_0008_0000$$$::"Yo. I was just killing time here, so don't mind me. I'll go outside if you need to talk about something important though."::
9348::$$$message_0070_0009_0000$$$::"It's fine. You're not an outsider anyway.[lr]::
9349::$$$message_0070_0009_0001$$$::More than that, I saw you brewing some tea. [cacheimage storage=美綴01b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=美綴01b(中)]One for me and Matou too, please."[lr]::
9350::$$$message_0070_0009_0002$$$::"M-Mitsuzuri-senpai! It's fine, Senpai. We'll leave right after we finish talking, so please do not worry about it!"[lr]::
9351::$$$message_0070_0009_0003$$$::She told me not to worry about it.[lr]::
9352::$$$message_0070_0009_0004$$$::But well, I might as well brew tea for the four of us anyway.::
9353::$$$message_0070_0010_0000$$$::"It doesn't seem like you came for our refreshments. What did you come to the student council room for, Ayako Mitsuzuri?"[lr]::
9354::$$$message_0070_0010_0001$$$::The student council president, who doesn't get along with athletic clubs, has gone on alert.::
9355::$$$message_0070_0011_0000$$$::"Yeah. First is this, the kyudo club's submission. We made it on time, right?"[lr]::
9356::$$$message_0070_0011_0001$$$::"Yes, there is still time until 4 PM.[lr]::
9357::$$$message_0070_0011_0002$$$::Let's see... Oh, a play. It is a low competition genre, there is no reason to not accept it. The content inspection will be another time."::
9358::$$$message_0070_0012_0000$$$::"Okay. Let's get down to the main topic."[lr]::
9359::$$$message_0070_0012_0001$$$::"The main topic?"::
9360::$$$message_0070_0013_0000$$$::"Yeah, it's basically a checklist.[lr]::
9361::$$$message_0070_0013_0001$$$::We could keep quiet about it, but we thought we should run the idea by the student council just in case."::
9362::$$$message_0070_0014_0000$$$::"Run the idea by us? Are you scheming something again, Captain Mitsuzuri?"::
9363::$$$message_0070_0015_0000$$$::"I'm the former captain, the current captain is Matou right here.[lr]::
9364::$$$message_0070_0015_0001$$$::The kyudo club has switched to a new system, so I would like for you to stop bringing up the past. The new captain is a kind senpai who cares for the members."[lr]::
9365::$$$message_0070_0015_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri says, while taking control of the conversation.::
9366::$$$message_0070_0016_0000$$$::"I see. It must have become a different kyudo club than before Miss Matou's leadership.[lr]::
9367::$$$message_0070_0016_0001$$$::However, what about it? The new captain greeting has been long done. You're not planning to say to increase the club budget or change the advisor at this point, are you?"[lr]::
9368::$$$message_0070_0016_0002$$$::"N-No, of course not.[lr]::
9369::$$$message_0070_0016_0003$$$::This year's agreement has already been decided, and I think it is correct."::
9370::$$$message_0070_0017_0000$$$::"Then, what other problems are there? There is the fall tournament for the kyudo club if I recall correctly, but are there any special measures necessary for that?[lr]::
9371::$$$message_0070_0017_0001$$$::Oh, come to think of it, the results of the kyudo club this year have been so poor that it's difficult to recall anything. Well, there's no numbers to recall if the results are zero."[lr]::
9372::$$$message_0070_0017_0002$$$::Issei's student council switch has turned on.[lr]::
9373::$$$message_0070_0017_0003$$$::When this happens, his usual tolerance falls silent, and he transforms into a merciless demon president.::
9374::$$$message_0070_0018_0000$$$::"Uhh, Mister Student Council President. How about you keep your scolding to a minimum? After all, it's their inevitable fate that their organizational capacity will decline as it's a new system."::
9375::$$$message_0070_0019_0000$$$::"You be quiet, Emiya.[lr]::
9376::$$$message_0070_0019_0001$$$::So, how may I help you, Miss Matou? Just to make it clear beforehand, I cannot approve extending morning practices and afternoon club activities. The student council's motto is prioritizing our studies first and foremost."::
9377::$$$message_0070_0020_0000$$$::"Well, there are some exceptions.[lr]::
9378::$$$message_0070_0020_0001$$$::If the average scores of the kyudo members greatly drop, then we shall consider reducing club hours."[lr]::
9379::$$$message_0070_0020_0002$$$::He smiles, while giving a death sentence.[lr]::
9380::$$$message_0070_0020_0003$$$::There is another demon here at Homurahara. I could see a glimpse of why he and Tohsaka fight like cats and dogs.::
9381::$$$message_0070_0021_0000$$$::"Hey, wait up. Sure, our duty as students is to study, but that's when we're at school.[lr]::
9382::$$$message_0070_0021_0001$$$::You're not going to intervene in our free time on weekends, right?[lr]::
9383::$$$message_0070_0021_0002$$$::That would deny our autonomy as students. There's a possibility that if we're tied down that much, we'll grow up to be humans who won't be able to use our own free time freely."::
9384::$$$message_0070_0022_0000$$$::"Humph. It's twisted logic, but that is true. It is your individual freedom on how you use your weekends.[lr]::
9385::$$$message_0070_0022_0001$$$::However, what about it?"::
9386::$$$message_0070_0023_0000$$$::"Y-Yes. Um, we would like to utilize our break to do a training camp in order to work towards improving the sense of unity and leadership of the kyudo members.[lr]::
9387::$$$message_0070_0023_0001$$$::It is a mini training camp of one night and two days only using Saturday and Sunday."::
9388::$$$message_0070_0024_0000$$$::"I see. So you would like approval for that.[lr]::
9389::$$$message_0070_0024_0001$$$::...However, you are at the wrong place. If you would like to get approval, please go to the faculty office. That is something for the teachers to supervise."::
9390::$$$message_0070_0025_0000$$$::"Ms. Fujimura agreed right away.[lr]::
9391::$$$message_0070_0025_0001$$$::But the problem is the place and experience. There are no lodges that will let us do a training camp without an appointment during this time."::
9392::$$$message_0070_0026_0000$$$::"I bet.[lr]::
9393::$$$message_0070_0026_0001$$$::Also, even beyond the fact that you don't even have an appointment, you can't pay for any accommodation fees without any budget either."::
9394::$$$message_0070_0027_0000$$$::"Y-Yes, that's right![lr]::
9395::$$$message_0070_0027_0001$$$::So, um... I heard that Ryudou Temple often rented out a big room to the Homurahara students..."::
9396::$$$message_0070_0028_0000$$$::"That is very unfortunate.[lr]::
9397::$$$message_0070_0028_0001$$$::Miss Matou, that system was discontinued last night."[lr]::
9398::$$$message_0070_0028_0002$$$::"Issei. Your father says we can stay as long as we want at the temple if we do community service. The mountain in the back has been completely neglected, right?"[lr]::
9399::$$$message_0070_0028_0003$$$::I reproach Issei, as if to say lying isn't good.::
9400::$$$message_0070_0029_0000$$$::"There you go. Student Council President, can you negotiate with Ryudou Temple?[lr]::
9401::$$$message_0070_0029_0001$$$::Actually, the student council president can't reject the requests of troubled students, right?"::
9402::$$$message_0070_0030_0000$$$::"You fool, I don't let my personal feelings get in the way of public affairs. I will refuse if I decide that it is not appropriate, whether they are a classmate or a comrade.[lr]::
9403::$$$message_0070_0030_0001$$$::...Well, I do hear that the new kyudo club is not on track yet. [cacheimage storage=一成02b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=一成02b(中)]Nevertheless, it is difficult to improve one's craft in a day or two, but I bet the sense of unity will increase."::
9404::$$$message_0070_0031_0000$$$::"Exactly! What's necessary right now for everyone is mutual understanding, or like making it clear of what kind of person everyone is, or discussing who likes who in the middle of the night!"[lr]::
9405::$$$message_0070_0031_0001$$$::Sakura gets enthusiastic all of a sudden.[lr]::
9406::$$$message_0070_0031_0002$$$::It seems like she was worrying about a lot of things as the new captain, but I feel like she's slightly going in the wrong direction.::
9407::$$$message_0070_0032_0000$$$::"However, Miss Matou.[lr]::
9408::$$$message_0070_0032_0001$$$::It is way too sudden. Besides, even that Miss Mitsuzuri over there has experienced it twice.[lr]::
9409::$$$message_0070_0032_0002$$$::Leaving a training camp up to people like that is..."::
9410::$$$message_0070_0033_0000$$$::"Yes, that's the problem. So, Student Council President.[lr]::
9411::$$$message_0070_0033_0001$$$::How about Matou and I, and that Emiya over there, go to the training camp at Ryudou Temple?"[lr]::
9412::$$$message_0070_0033_0002$$$::Oh... I see, come to think of it, they were talking about that before.::
9413::$$$message_0070_0034_0000$$$::"It's a rehearsal if you ask me. If you're worried, you can join as well. This way, we can get a sense of what a training camp is like, and we can hold the formal one a week later.[lr]::
9414::$$$message_0070_0034_0001$$$::What do you think? You won't have any complaints with this, right? The ones that will be staying at Ryudou Temple are Matou, Emiya, and I.[lr]::
9415::$$$message_0070_0034_0002$$$::Oh, and obviously Emiya is a boy, so make sure to prepare a boys' room. There are boys in the kyudo club too, so this should also be a good simulation, right?"::
9416::$$$message_0070_0035_0000$$$::"Oh... Hold on. Mitsuzuri, um."[lr]::
9417::$$$message_0070_0035_0001$$$::Wasn't there another person, a member that's like Issei's nemesis, that also expressed their interest in participating...?[lr]::
9418::$$$message_0070_0035_0002$$$::"All right. It cannot be helped. Then I shall approve of it."[lr]::
9419::$$$message_0070_0035_0003$$$::"Hnng!?"[lr]::
9420::$$$message_0070_0035_0004$$$::Issei nods.[lr]::
9421::$$$message_0070_0035_0005$$$::What's up with that sudden change of attitude!?::
9422::$$$message_0070_0036_0000$$$::"R-Really!? Then um, we can have a training camp as soon as you have finished preparing!?"::
9423::$$$message_0070_0037_0000$$$::"I do not mind. I shall speak with my father.[lr]::
9424::$$$message_0070_0037_0001$$$::Just to confirm, it will be only Miss Matou, Miss Mitsuzuri, and Emiya, correct?"::
9425::$$$message_0070_0038_0000$$$::"Yes. There will probably be one more person joining to help out, but you don't mind if there's an extra person or two, right?"[lr]::
9426::$$$message_0070_0038_0001$$$::"Of course. I shall get rooms for about twenty people ready to prepare for the real thing."::
9427::$$$message_0070_0039_0000$$$::The three of them smile in agreement.[lr]::
9428::$$$message_0070_0039_0001$$$::One participant is being left behind.[lr]::
9429::$$$message_0070_0039_0002$$$::Then...[lr]::
9430::$$$message_0070_0039_0003$$$::"WAIT UPPPPPPPPP!!!!!"[rf]::
9431::$$$message_0070_0040_0000$$$::A savior, as if expressing my feelings on my behalf...[lr]::
9432::$$$message_0070_0040_0001$$$::"Stop enjoying life! The black panther of Homurahara won't accept only approving a training camp for the kyudo club!"[lr]::
9433::$$$message_0070_0040_0002$$$::...doesn't appear.::
9434::$$$message_0070_0041_0000$$$::                                           "Makidera-senpai...?"[lr]::
9435::$$$message_0070_0041_0001$$$::                                                                                  "Makidera...?"[lr]::
9436::$$$message_0070_0041_0002$$$::                    "Ma-diot...?"[lr]::
9437::$$$message_0070_0041_0003$$$::The three of them express their surprise to the sudden intruder.::
9438::$$$message_0070_0042_0000$$$::"Muahahaha, that's right![lr]::
9439::$$$message_0070_0042_0001$$$::Some respect me as Makidera Senpai, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]some just call me Makidera, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]and then some affectionately call me Ma-diot; [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服04e(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=蒔寺制服04e(近)]the track club [wvl][se storage=se106.wav][shock vmax=15 time=500 count=5]ace, Kaede Makidera![lr]::
9440::$$$message_0070_0042_0002$$$::Wait, wasn't there something weird mixed in there, Emiyaaaa!?"::
9441::$$$message_0070_0043_0000$$$::"Ahh, ow! You're always off target! Aim for the one who's laughing right there!"[lr]::
9442::$$$message_0070_0043_0001$$$::"Whaaat? You seem sturdy, so you're worth kicking."::
9443::$$$message_0070_0044_0000$$$::The second wild animal that appeared at Homurahara pulls back her feet. [font italic=true]What's up with her?[font italic=false][lr]::
9444::$$$message_0070_0044_0001$$$::By the way, the glass window that looked like it was convincingly broken was, in actuality, not.::
9445::$$$message_0070_0045_0000$$$::"Makidera. I have many complaints, but I shall hear your objective. No, just tell me your objective."[lr]::
9446::$$$message_0070_0045_0001$$$::Issei's suggestion is correct indeed.[lr]::
9447::$$$message_0070_0045_0002$$$::If we let Makidera do what she wants, then everything that has just been discussed would most likely come to nothing.::
9448::$$$message_0070_0046_0000$$$::"Objective? Heh, that's not even worth mentioning.[lr]::
9449::$$$message_0070_0046_0001$$$::I heard everything, Student Council President. The kyudo club is doing a training camp, right? But that's sneaky. All the athletic training camps have been turned down left and right ever since you became the student council president. I can't overlook the kyudo club being the only one allowed to at this point."[lr]::
9450::$$$message_0070_0046_0002$$$::I'm surprised. Makidera can actually make a serious counterattack.::
9451::$$$message_0070_0047_0000$$$::"What, are you trying to nitpick, Makidera? You can't forgive the kyudo club getting ahead?"::
9452::$$$message_0070_0048_0000$$$::"Yeah. We wanted to do training camps many times when we were active members. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01d(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01d(近)]Include me. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服03c(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=蒔寺制服03c(近)]We also want to do a training camp even now. We want to do it before the kyudo club. I want to do one no matter what.[lr]::
9453::$$$message_0070_0048_0001$$$::Because. [wvl canskip=0 time=400]Yes, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]that is because...!"[lr]::
9454::$$$message_0070_0048_0002$$$::"Oh! Umm, it's because you're faster than anyone else, right!?"::
9455::$$$message_0070_0049_0000$$$::"H-Hey, don't steal my catchphrase![stoplquake layer=all][lr]::
9456::$$$message_0070_0049_0001$$$::Dammit, Mitsuzuri's way of teaching has gotten into the kyudo club juniors!"[lr]::
9457::$$$message_0070_0049_0002$$$::Makidera [wait canskip=0 time=400][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=100 accel=0 storage=white][wm canskip=0][se storage=se073.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=0 top=0 time=200 accel=0 storage=white][wm canskip=0][shock vmax=20 time=600 count=7]boisterously acts out of spite. [wait canskip=0 time=600][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=0 top=0 time=100 accel=0 storage=white][wm canskip=0][se storage=se075.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=0 top=0 time=200 accel=0 storage=white][wm canskip=0][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=9]Sakura watches over her warmly.[lr]::
9458::$$$message_0070_0049_0003$$$::I see. Sakura is used to these kinds of creatures!::
9459::$$$message_0070_0050_0000$$$::"...Geez.[lr]::
9460::$$$message_0070_0050_0001$$$::Then do the trial training camp with Miss Matou and the others, Makidera. I don't have any complaints if the track club is under the same conditions."[lr]::
9461::$$$message_0070_0050_0002$$$::"Mrgh... Does that mean a joint training camp with the kyudo club and the track club?"::
9462::$$$message_0070_0051_0000$$$::"That's what would happen. But it can't be just you.[lr]::
9463::$$$message_0070_0051_0001$$$::There's no guarantee that the people of the track club will want to do a training camp in the first place. We won't let you participate unless the supporters reach more than half, or the current captain gives the green light.[lr]::
9464::$$$message_0070_0051_0002$$$::Makidera, can you convince the track club?"::
9465::$$$message_0070_0052_0000$$$::"H-Heh, no need to worry about that![lr]::
9466::$$$message_0070_0052_0001$$$::If I invite them, a person or two like Himuro or Yukicchi will join!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
9467::$$$message_0070_0052_0002$$$::...[lr]::
9468::$$$message_0070_0052_0003$$$::I see, Makidera only has those two.::
9469::$$$message_0070_0053_0000$$$::"All right, strike while the iron is hot if it's decided.[lr]::
9470::$$$message_0070_0053_0001$$$::We'll prepare right away, so you hurry too![cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服02c(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=蒔寺制服02c(遠)][se storage=se452.wav][move spread=1 mx=93 magnify=1.5 time=400 my=155 path=(93,155,255,2)(93,155,0,1) storage=白光b accel=0][wait canskip=0 time=100][move spread=1 mx=57 magnify=1.5 time=500 my=209 path=(57,209,255,2)(57,209,0,1) storage=白光d accel=0][wait canskip=0 time=100][move spread=1 mx=208 magnify=1.3 time=400 my=181 path=(208,181,255,2)(208,181,0,1) storage=白光c accel=0][wait canskip=0 time=100][move spread=1 mx=215 magnify=1.3 time=500 my=247 path=(215,247,255,2)(215,247,0,1) storage=白光e accel=0][wait canskip=0 time=100] Yay, next weekend is a training camp!"[lr]::
9471::$$$message_0070_0053_0002$$$::Makidera yelps out, as she goes out the window.[lr]::
9472::$$$message_0070_0053_0003$$$::...To sum up the conversation until now, the trial training camp is us four and the three from the track club... I think?::
9473::$$$message_0070_0054_0000$$$::"Do you want some tea by the way? I brewed it for the four of us."[lr]::
9474::$$$message_0070_0054_0001$$$::I pull myself together and put down the cut red bean jelly and four cups of tea on the table.[lr]::
9475::$$$message_0070_0054_0002$$$::"...I'll drink it. Man, I think this sometimes, but you're quite a big shot."::
9476::$$$message_0070_0055_0000$$$::Mitsuzuri sighs, as she pulls out a chair.[lr]::
9477::$$$message_0070_0055_0001$$$::It's a bit before 3 PM.[lr]::
9478::$$$message_0070_0055_0002$$$::It's become break time before we even realized it.::
909414::$$$message_9070_0034_0001$$$::"What do you think? You won't have any complaints with this, right? The ones that will be staying at Ryudou Temple are Matou, Emiya, and I."::

